# Feature: account
# Use-case: uc.account.reset-password
# Use-case doc: ../../../../docs/wiki/features/account/use-cases/uc.account.reset-password.md

### Request password reset
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/me/password-reset/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{passwordResetEmail}}"
}

### Exchange reset token for RECOVERY material
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/me/password-reset/material
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{passwordResetToken}}"
}

### Confirm password reset
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/me/password-reset/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{passwordResetToken}}",
  "newPassword": "{{newPassword}}",
  "masterKeyWrap": {
    "unlockMethod": "PASSWORD",
    "suiteId": "v1",
    "wrappedKey": "{{passwordMasterKeyWrap}}",
    "kdfParams": "{{passwordKdfParams}}"
  },
  "recoveryAuthTag": "{{recoveryAuthTag}}"
}
